{
  "key": "sound/kit-house-909",
  "kind": "sound",
  "summary": "TR-909 kit for house and techno: thumping kick, clap, sizzling closed and open hats, ride, rim",
  "tags": [
    "house",
    "techno",
    "deep house",
    "909",
    "TR-909",
    "kit",
    "drums",
    "dance",
    "four on the floor"
  ],
  "devices": [
    "Playfield"
  ],
  "links": [
    "pattern/four-on-the-floor",
    "genre/house",
    "genre/techno"
  ],
  "checked": {
    "how": "written",
    "by": "claude (style kits)",
    "date": "2026-11-24",
    "opendaw": "652e6ca"
  },
  "body": [
    "The Roland TR-909: the sound of house and techno. Kick on every beat, clap on 2 and 4, open hat on the off-beats (pattern/four-on-the-floor); the ride on the off-beats lifts a drop.",
    "Apply makes a new drum track (it never replaces the old one): park the old drums (mute) at the bar the new kit starts. Pads are named by role, so drum patterns and evolve_notes find them; samples (the tool) finds other sounds to swap in with make_kit."
  ],
  "apply": {
    "params": {
      "pattern": {
        "type": "text",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "a knowledge drum pattern for it to play from the start (\"pattern/trap-2bar\"); leave out for an empty kit"
      },
      "from_bar": {
        "type": "number",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "the timeline bar its region starts on (loop off: the next bar line after it lands)"
      },
      "bars": {
        "type": "number",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "how many bars it runs (loop off: to the song's end)"
      },
      "name": {
        "type": "text",
        "optional": true
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "op": "kit",
        "input": {
          "name": "$name",
          "default_name": "909 Kit",
          "volume_db": -3,
          "pads": [
            {
              "role": "kick",
              "sample": "RolandTR909/bd/Bassdrum-02"
            },
            {
              "role": "clap",
              "sample": "RolandTR909/cp/Clap"
            },
            {
              "role": "snare",
              "sample": "RolandTR909/sd/sd03"
            },
            {
              "role": "closed_hat",
              "sample": "RolandTR909/hh/hh01"
            },
            {
              "role": "open_hat",
              "sample": "RolandTR909/oh/oh01"
            },
            {
              "role": "ride",
              "sample": "RolandTR909/rd/rd01"
            },
            {
              "role": "rim",
              "sample": "RolandTR909/rim/rs01"
            },
            {
              "role": "crash",
              "sample": "RolandTR909/cr/cr01"
            }
          ],
          "notes": {
            "of": "$pattern",
            "from_bar": "$from_bar",
            "bars": "$bars"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
